rule ROUTE104 "csrf-protection-exempted" {
  lang python
  severity error

  find c: call where c.text ~ /csrf(_protect)?\.exempt\(/
  report c "a view is exempted from CSRF protection"

  example fire python """
    csrf.exempt(transfer_view)  #~ error
  """
  example clean python """
    csrf.init_app(app)
  """
  example notapplicable markdown """
    Prose has no views.
  """
  explain """
    A state-changing view that skips the CSRF check can be driven by any page the user visits while signed in.
    ## Remedy
    Remove the exemption and send the CSRF token with the request; for a token-authenticated API, authenticate with the header token instead of the cookie.
  """
}
